SUMMARY:Drop-In Pickleball
LOCATION:11/06/2026 - 05/07/2027 08:00 AM - 10:00 AM Norwood Civic Center - Gymnasium
DESCRIPTION:A combination of tennis\, badminton\, ping pong and racquetball - one of the fastest growing sports in America! A few racquets and balls are available for newcomers. Participants must help set up and break down at the end of each class. Drop in style pickleball - players of all skill levels and ages are welcome to join. Friday mornings from 8:00am-10:00am Civic Center Gym Drop-In Fee: Res: $5.00/NR: $7.00 Schedule is subject to change\, please call ahead. 781-762-0466. Closed on holidays and school vacation weeks!\nCost: $5.00 Res\, $7.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30942
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30942
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rec-occurrence-rec-fc27544fe5d5-2027-04-02@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261002T000026Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270402T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270402T120000
SUMMARY:Indoor Tot Time - Fridays
LOCATION:09/18/2026 - 04/16/2027 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM Norwood Civic Center - Gymnasium
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for fun and safe play for your child during the fall/winter months? Would you like to meet local parents with children similar in age to your child? Look no further! This program will allow your children to explore a large open space and interact with other children. Climbing mats\, sports equipment\, and play equipment will all be pulled out for the kids to enjoy. Parents/caregivers must accompany their children at all times during this unstructured program. No fee for children under 1 if accompanied by a sibling. $5.00 per day per family (Drop-In) NO FOOD OR DRINKS IN THE GYM PLEASE! NO TOT TIME DURING VACATION WEEKS OR DAYS WHEN CIVIC CENTER IS CLOSED.\nCost: $75.00 Res\, $75.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30920
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30920
END:VEVENT
